OL,3,GNEWSA'My son will die without cannabis
OL,4,Amedication'
OL,5,
OL,6,FA mother has said her 17-year-old son
OL,7,Fwill die without an epilepsy medicine
OL,8,Fwhich is set to become inaccessible in
OL,9,Fthe UK.
OL,11,FJoanne, from Preston, is calling on the
OL,12,Fprime minister to ensure medical
OL,13,Fcannabis will continue to be available
OL,14,Fin the UK as her son Ben is running out
OL,15,Fof his supply.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,403,400,260,160,0,100
PN,40202
SC,0002
CT,3,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F402A1795157840
OL,1,W5j 5Q7kj 5j js17kjc15 js57kj#4
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,-. *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'My son will die without cannabis
OL,4,Amedication'
OL,5,
OL,6,FBen has severe drug-resistant epilepsy
OL,7,Fand has been prescribed medicinal
OL,8,Fcannabis in the form of Bedrolite and
OL,9,FBedica oils for the last seven years,
OL,10,Fbut Bedrocan, the Dutch pharmacy
OL,11,Fdispensing the UK-prescribed medicines,
OL,12,Fis set to close on 1 December.
OL,14,F"My son is going to die," Joanne said,
OL,15,Fadding that Ben has about "five weeks"
OL,16,Fof medication left.
